   "widgets_values": [
    "A sleek, elegant cat stretching in profile, composed of crisp geometric paper planes. Each body section uses a distinct flat color: burnt orange, teal, cream, and slate gray. Thin ink outlines define the silhouette and joints, while select panels feature tiny stepped geometric motifs. Behind the cat, a large floating ring intersects with a diagonal color bar and a small checkerboard panel, evoking graceful forward motion on a pale gray-beige background. The feline casts a sharply defined geometric drop shadow, adding modern dimensionality while maintaining a flat graphic poster look. Modern pop-art poster design, Bauhaus constructivism, screen-print texture, elegant asymmetrical composition, crisp color separations, generous negative space, visually simple and intentional, no text, no logos., muted minimalist sketch style"
